        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, in 2025, we invested in the development and launch of Muse, an AI-powered tool, to inspire and personalize the home shopping experience by providing customers inspiration and ideas to build their aspirational home.",
