        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are subject to domestic and foreign laws and regulations regarding general business, as well as laws and regulations governing the Internet and e-commerce, many of which are still evolving.",
